WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
An email to your French friend Hugo.

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.100
Three bullets, about 90 words.

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.630
Your last holiday.

4
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.650
What you like doing on holiday.

5
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.620
Your plans for next summer.

6
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.890
You start with «Salut Hugo !»,

7
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.530
then write and write about your holiday.

8
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.130
The word count runs out.

9
00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.230
Two bullets sit empty.

10
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:22.110
So how do you hit every
bullet point in a French

11
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.910
writing task without running out of words?

12
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.470
In this mission, you'll take
apart a model email to Hugo,

13
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.880
line by line.

14
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.750
Then you'll learn to sweep
your own text for slips

15
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.670
before time runs out.

16
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.780
Your mission: plan your words,

17
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.430
and cover every bullet.
